This is 99% invisible. I'm Roman Mars. Here's a trick. If you want to design a good flag, a kick-ass flag like Chicago's or DC's. Start by drawing a 1 by 1 and a half inch rectangle on a piece of paper. Your design has to work within that tiny rectangle. Here's one. A 3 by 5 foot flag on a pole 100 feet away looks about the same size as a one by one and a half inch rectangle seen about 15 inches from your eye. So instead of starting with a big canvas or a wide cinnamon display Try drawing your flag on a rectangle as one by one and a half inches
